gps-station (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release.
  * gps-station-desktop: tray icon that shows and keeps the grid square of
    running ham programs (radio, WSJT-X, JTDX, JS8Call, fldigi, QSSTV).
  * gps-station-lo-multicast.service: turn on multicast for the loopback
    interface at boot, so WSJT-X can share its UDP stream on lo.

 -- Jeffrey Honig <jch@honig.net>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:00:00 -0400
